  Id: doctor
  DisplayName: Call a Doctor
  Description: "Situation\u2019s getting worse in here. Too many wounded, not enough
    supplies, and the people who knew how to patch bullet holes are either drunk
    or dead.\n\nWe\u2019re burning through medkits faster than ammo. Doesn\u2019t
    matter where you find them \u2014 clinics, ambulances, bodies \u2014 just bring
    me something usable before infections finish what the bullets started.\n\nAnd
    try not to use them all on yourself before you get back."
